Package: pulzr-adopt
Provides: parkeze-adopt
Replaces: parkeze-adopt
Conflicts: parkeze-adopt
Depends: pulzr-base, ucode, ucode-mod-uci, curl, ca-bundle, openssl-util, qrencode, jsonfilter
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: all
Description: One-touch provisioning and adoption.
 Mints a claim identity at first boot, shows it as a QR over SSH and in the
 console, and completes adoption on its own once somebody scans it. Receives
 MQTT credentials and the fleet recovery anchor, and enrols the gateway's
 WireGuard key for the management tunnel. Once adopted, reports what the
 gateway is and sends its system log to Pulzr Cloud (pulzr-logship).
